D2_eq32_w5      GREEN                          N21 verbatim: on refusing 32, write 5
D2_lo32z_w5     GREEN                          N21 class: on refusing a value whose low 32 bits are 0, write 5
D2_eq32_w7      RED:B sb,sh,sw,sd              control: on refusing 32, write 7
D2_eq2p40_w5    GREEN                          on refusing 2^40, write 5
D2_eq2p40_w7    RED:B sd                       on refusing 2^40, write 7
D2_eq2p32_w5    GREEN                          on refusing 2^32, write 5
D2_eq2p32_w7    RED:B sd                       on refusing 2^32, write 7
D2_lo32z_w7     RED:P 0x200000000,W 2^63,B sd  on refusing a value whose low 32 bits are 0, write 7
D2_eqffff_w5    GREEN                          on refusing 0xffffffff (P's all-ones by sw, refused only at 5), write 5
D2_eqX3_w3      GREEN                          on refusing 0x100000005 (X3's value, refused only at 3), write 3
N1_mask4        GREEN                          N1 verbatim: while the latch is clear the compare ignores bit 4
N1_mask40       GREEN                          N1 at bit 40: while the latch is clear the compare ignores bit 40
N2_lo3ne6       GREEN                          N2 verbatim: refuse only when the low three bits are not 6
N2_lo3ne2       GREEN                          N2 at low-3 value 2
N2_lo3ne5       RED:X3 x3                      control: low-3 value 5 (X3's 0x100000005)
B_mod107        RED:B count                    latch re-armed every 107 refusals
B_mod108        GREEN                          latch re-armed every 108 refusals
MKB_05          RED:B sb,sh,sw,sd              table 6 text: the compare ignores bit 5 alone
MKB_31          RED:B sw,sd                    table 6 text: the compare ignores bit 31 alone
MKB_40          RED:B sd                       table 6 text: the compare ignores bit 40 alone
MKB_63          RED:W 2^63,B sd                table 6 text: the compare ignores bit 63 alone
DSC_ann_hibits  GREEN                          table 6 text: no announce for a value whose bits all lie above bit 8
